CLASS net/minecraft/ResourceLocationException net/minecraft/IdentifierException
	COMMENT Represents an exception thrown when parsing or constructing an {@link net.minecraft.resources.Identifier}
	COMMENT that contains an invalid character.
	COMMENT This should not be caught, instead {@link net.minecraft.resources.Identifier#tryParse} or {@link net.minecraft.resources.Identifier#fromNamespaceAndPath} should be used.
	METHOD <init> (Ljava/lang/String;)V
		ARG 1 message
	METHOD <init> (Ljava/lang/String;Ljava/lang/Throwable;)V
		ARG 1 message
		ARG 2 cause
